    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "class_e_03_battle_02",
      "hash64": "60E84C9A515A8E67",
      "text": "Wie ihr euch sicher erinnert, haben wir beim\\nletzten Mal über Tera-Raids gesprochen.\\r\\nVielleicht hat jemand von euch sogar die Theorie\\r\\nbereits in die Praxis umgesetzt?[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 136,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 172,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "class_e_03_battle_03",
      "hash64": "60E84B9A515A8CB4",
      "text": "In diesem Fall dürfte euch aufgefallen sein,\\nwie gefährlich Terakristall-Pokémon sind.\\c\\nWarum? Tja, das hat viele Gründe. Einer davon\\nist eine bestimmte Aktion, von der die besonders\\r\\nStarken unter ihnen Gebrauch machen...[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 184,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 226,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "class_e_03_battle_04",
      "hash64": "60E84A9A515A8B01",
      "text": "Ich rede vom [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]Tera-Schild[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "class_e_03_battle_05",
      "hash64": "60E8499A515A894E",
      "text": "Während ein Pokémon einen Tera-Schild\\nverwendet...[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 50,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "class_e_03_battle_06",
      "hash64": "60E8489A515A879B",
      "text": "...erleidet es deutlich weniger Schaden.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 40,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "class_e_03_battle_07",
      "hash64": "60E8479A515A85E8",
      "text": "Wenn es dazu kommt, kann es richtig schlecht\\nfür euch aussehen...[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 65,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "class_e_03_battle_08",
      "hash64": "60E8469A515A8435",
      "text": "Dann gibt es keinen Silberstreifen am Horizont\\nund eure Niederlage scheint unabwendbar![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "class_e_03_battle_09",
      "hash64": "60E8459A515A8282",
      "text": "Zeit für eine Frage![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "class_e_03_battle_10",
      "hash64": "60E4C89A51577844",
      "text": "Was solltet ihr tun, wenn euer Gegner einen\\nTera-Schild verwendet?[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 66,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "class_e_03_select_01",
      "hash64": "AB71E26C3F620374",
      "text": "Die Augen schließen!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "class_e_03_select_02",
      "hash64": "AB71E56C3F62088D",
      "text": "Mama anrufen!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "class_e_03_select_03",
      "hash64": "AB71E46C3F6206DA",
      "text": "Terakristallisieren und angreifen!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "class_e_03_battle_answer_01",
      "hash64": "956C446586DBA4F3",
      "text": "Du willst deine Niederlage einfach akzeptieren?\\nNiemals. Wer nach einem Ausweg sucht, wird ihn\\r\\nauch finden![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 110,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "class_e_03_battle_answer_02",
      "hash64": "956C456586DBA6A6",
      "text": "Du willst deine Niederlage akzeptieren und bei\\ndeiner Mutter Trost suchen? Die kann dir nicht\\r\\nhelfen. Nur wer nach einem Ausweg sucht,\\r\\nwird ihn auch finden![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 137,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 162,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "class_e_03_battle_answer_03",
      "hash64": "956C466586DBA859",
      "text": "Richtig! Ich sehe schon, wir haben es hier mit\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,1614,0000)]einem wahren Meistereiner wahren Meisterin des Tera-Raids zu tun.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 47,
          "count": 4,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "1614",
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 118,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "class_e_03_battle_11",
      "hash64": "60E4C99A515779F7",
      "text": "Gewöhnliche Angriffe zeigen nur wenig Wirkung\\nbei Pokémon, die einen Tera-Schild verwenden.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "class_e_03_battle_12",
      "hash64": "60E4CA9A51577BAA",
      "text": "Doch wenn ihr bei eurem Pokémon die\\nTerakristallisierung auslöst und dann angreift,\\r\\nkann sich das Blatt zu euren Gunsten wenden.\\c\\nSetzt ihr zudem eine Attacke vom selben Typ wie\\nsein Tera-Typ ein, fügt ihr noch mehr Schaden zu![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 131,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 232,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "class_e_03_battle_13",
      "hash64": "60E4CB9A51577D5D",
      "text": "Fügt eurem Gegner fortlaufend Schaden zu,\\num seinen Tera-Schild zu brechen und ihn so\\r\\nins Wanken zu bringen![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 111,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "class_e_03_battle_14",
      "hash64": "60E4C49A51577178",
      "text": "Wie ihr seht, spielt das richtige Timing einer\\nTerakristallisierung während des Tera-Raids\\r\\neine wichtige Rolle.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 114,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "class_e_03_battle_15",
      "hash64": "60E4C59A5157732B",
      "text": "Ich fasse noch einmal zusammen![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "class_e_03_battle_16",
      "hash64": "60E4C69A515774DE",
      "text": "Bekämpft Feuer mit Feuer und wendet die Kraft\\nder Terakristallisierung gegen Gegner an, die sie\\r\\nsich ebenfalls zunutze machen.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 129,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "class_e_03_battle_17",
      "hash64": "60E4C79A51577691",
      "text": "Denkt daran, dass ihr nicht allein seid. Arbeitet\\ngut mit euren Mitstreitern zusammen, um den\\r\\nTera-Schild der Gegenseite zu durchbrechen.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 140,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "class_e_03_battle_18",
      "hash64": "60E4C09A51576AAC",
      "text": "Hmm, zur praktischen Demonstration kommen wir\\nheute wohl wieder nicht.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 70,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "class_e_03_battle_19",
      "hash64": "60E4C19A51576C5F",
      "text": "Beim nächsten Mal steht die Zwischenprüfung an.\\nUm die volle Punktzahl zu erhalten, müsst ihr so\\r\\nunnachgiebig sein wie bei einem Tera-Raid![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
